@host = http://localhost:3000
@id = 5

### 1. Lihat koleksi (awalnya [] dan status 200)
GET {{host}}/api/collection

### 2. Tambah tanaman ke koleksi (status 201)
POST {{host}}/api/collection
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plantId": 1, "lastWatered": "2026-11-24" }

### 3. Tandai sudah disiram (lastWatered berubah)
PATCH {{host}}/api/collection/{{id}}/water
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lastWatered": "2026-11-25" }

### 4. Ganti nama panggilan
PATCH {{host}}/api/collection/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "Monstera Kamar" }

### 5. Error: plantId tidak ada (harus 404)
POST {{host}}/api/collection
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plantId": 9999, "lastWatered": "2026-11-24" }

### 6. Error: format tanggal salah (harus 400)
POST {{host}}/api/collection
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plantId": 1, "lastWatered": "24-11-2026" }

### 7. Hapus item (status 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/collection/{{id}}

### 8. Hapus lagi, item sudah tidak ada (harus 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/collection/{{id}}
